# Shared package (`packages/shared`)

- Stay **framework-agnostic**: no Nest or Next imports
- Export UI components, pure utils, constants, and types only
- No secrets, env with credentials, or server-only DB/Prisma code
- Consumers: `@numee/candidate`, `@numee/recruiter`, `@numee/admin` (and others via `@numee/shared`)
